    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n17215" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄτρῐχος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄθριξ</span>
			, <i>without hair,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Call.
				<u>Dian.</u>
				77
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				4.572
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			Subst., <i>serpent,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hes.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				96.91
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<i>preventing the growth of hair,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Aët.
				1.19
			</span></i>.</div>
